{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>香港天文台於今日（11月20日）凌晨零時四十五分發出特別天氣提示，指出受強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶影響，本港天氣顯著轉涼。密雲及有幾陣雨的情況下，日間氣溫將持續下降，並因風寒效應令體感溫度進一步降低。\n</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民，特別是進行戶外活動的人士，需密切留意天氣變化，並採取適當的保暖措施。同時，請特別關顧長者及慢性病患者，確保他們的健康不受寒冷天氣影響。</p>\n<p>市民應考慮穿著保暖衣物，避免長時間暴露於寒風中，並留意最新的天氣預報以作出適當安排。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e8%bd%89%e6%b6%bc/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣轉涼</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:01.088532+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:45:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T23:17:52.553861+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:20.119053+00:00","content_hash":"61b1c1531f6b3aca763d75084532bf8979fabebd464dd538ed5252a66556d622","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}